{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0e29aa9dc5a833d9307","chatId":"24cb31d0976b4b3c9075f61f26762458","sessionId":null,"userId":98925,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"C\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"C\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2024,"promptTokens":1631,"completionTokens":226,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:20:02"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009704486816766698,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0e29aa9dc5a833d9306","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482402523,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:20:02","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0e29aa9dc5a833d9306","chatId":"24cb31d0976b4b3c9075f61f26762458","sessionId":null,"userId":98925,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n我来自一个贫困的家庭。接收到大学的录取通知后的某一天，我的家人一起来祝贺我，并且给了我一个包作为第一个礼物。9年以后，我的丈夫和我结婚后搬家。打包时，他发现了一个又脏又旧的包。那个包是我的父母为了祝贺我被梦校录取的礼物。他想把包扔了，并且说这个包没用了我不需要它。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，我的丈夫最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 伤心 & 好奇\nB) 没意识的 & 好奇\nC) 没意识的 & 反感\nD) 没意识的 & 爱护\nE) 爱护 & 好奇\nF) 伤心 & 反感\n\n## 问题 2\n我的丈夫为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 他对我对包包寄予的感性价值感到厌恶 & 他不喜欢我上的大学\nB) 他对我们搬进一所脏乱的房子感到厌烦 & 他不喜欢我上的大学\nC) 他不想让我留着一个又旧又破的包 & 他不知道这个包对我的价值\nD) 他不知道这个包对我的价值 & 他不知道我喜欢古旧和生锈的包包。\nE) 他不知道这个包对我的价值 & 他对我们搬进一所脏乱的房子感到厌烦\nF) 他不想让我留着一个又旧又破的包 & 他对我们搬进一所脏乱的房子感到厌烦","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009704486816766698,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0e29aa9dc5a833d9307","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482402520,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:20:02","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"889d31e35c5a4cee8ae374c58200d640"}